From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jay Leaton <58495321+jayleaton@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 08:03:53 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 163/207] feat(runner): mark owned inline results behind an
 opt-in knob

Resolved against T2 64dcd5831 receipt records: every token is still recorded with its full bytes
(marker included) before the mark narrows what the scanner sees, and the owned record stays ahead
of the forcing state. The destroy join comment moves onto its line to keep runner.zig at 600.

(cherry picked from commit 9455a17e7d2d0b417779d0638761beaef9a6a861)
